{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"阿摩司書","commonName":"阿摩司書","title":"阿摩司書","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"5606ff53dbf6d121dcf5f38beb3bd015c6c14b0f2915d7372d34815a7afdda23","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"住在撒瑪利亞山上的巴珊肥母牛啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聽此言！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們壓榨貧寒人，欺凌窮苦人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又叫丈夫拿酒來暢飲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，主耶和華憑祂的聖潔起誓：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「時候快到了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有人要用魚鉤鉤走你們，一個也不留。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們都要從城牆缺口走出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被丟到哈門。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"「以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們去伯特利犯罪吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去吉甲增添罪惡吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要每天早晨獻上祭物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每三天奉上你們的十分之一。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們獻上帶酵的餅作感恩祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且到處誇耀你們自願獻的祭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人啊，這就是你們愛做的事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"「我在各城降下饑荒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們遍地缺糧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"儘管如此，你們仍不歸向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"「我在收割前三個月停止降雨。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在一座城降雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在另一座城不降雨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使一塊田有雨水的滋潤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"另一塊田因無雨而乾裂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"兩三座城的人都踉踉蹌蹌地湧到一座城找水喝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水卻不夠喝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"儘管如此，你們仍不歸向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"「我用熱風和黴災擊打你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫蝗蟲吞噬你們田園中的菜蔬、葡萄樹、無花果樹和橄欖樹。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"儘管如此，你們仍不歸向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"「我在你們中間降下瘟疫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如從前降在埃及一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我殺戮你們的青年，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擄掠你們的戰馬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們軍營中的死屍臭味撲鼻。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"儘管如此，你們仍不歸向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"「我在你們中間施行毀滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如從前毀滅所多瑪和蛾摩拉一樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們像從火裡抽出的一根柴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"儘管如此，你們仍不歸向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"「以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要這樣懲罰你們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"準備迎見你們的上帝吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我要這樣懲罰你們。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"看啊，那位造山又造風、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向人顯明其心意、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將黎明變為黑暗、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"踏在地之高處的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的名字是萬軍之上帝耶和華。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}